  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🚀 Infra Bootstrap — DSH-Plugin",
      "text": "> **基礎設施極簡入口**:`infra_status` 探測已掛載的整個棧(記憶 / 觀測 / 搜索 / 技能目錄 / 運行時),`infra_bootstrap` 輸出就緒判定。原 7-step SKILL.md 管線的結構化替代。\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@bryan-cmf/dsh-infra-bootstrap)\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "| Tool | Effect |\n| --- | --- |\n| `infra_status` | Probe each component and print per-line status |\n| `infra_bootstrap` | Same probe + final `PASS` / `WARN` verdict |\n\nProbes: `vectorMemory` service (records), sibling tools\n(`usage_report` / `audit_skills` / `infra_health` / `mem_save` / `mem_search`\n/ `cross_search`), skill catalog size, live agents and sessions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```jsonc\n\"dsh\": { \"profile\": { \"bundles\": [\"@bryan-cmf/dsh-infra-bootstrap\"] } }\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Requirements",
      "text": "- DSH `>= 0.1.0-rc.6` (`tools`, `skills` services)\n- Sibling packages are optional — MISSING lines tell you what to install"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install --store-dir .pnpm-store\npnpm build\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
